# shape: an SSI site (.shtml pages sharing a header partial by <!--#include virtual -->, a section page several
# directories deep, a card partial a posthtml page and an SSI page both pull in, each with its own stylesheet): the
# SPEC 11.2 questions an agent converting partials into components asks (hosts of a partial, what a page is
# assembled from, how one selector styles a partial on each host)
mode=queries
@@@ file: questions.tsv
# qid	template	grade	section	role	fields	ask	derive
Q36c	selector matches if fragment F were included in P at a placeholder comment	LINK	web	styled	at,rule_at,status	link parts/promo.html:1 shop.html:8 ;; impact ".card" --in shop.html ;; link parts/promo.html:1 -	asserted_styles parts/promo.html@shop.html:8|shop.html|.card
Q49	where is fragment F included (its hosts, at the directive)	SET	web	included_by	at	impact parts/card.html	included_by parts/card.html
Q50	which fragments page P includes, and where	SET	web	includes	at,fragment	impact index.shtml	includes index.shtml
Q51	how selector X styles a fragment on each host	SET	web	styled	at,rule_at,host,status	impact .card	host_styled .card
@@@ file: src/css/shop.css
.card { b: 1 }
.shop > .card .t { b: 2 }
@@@ file: src/css/site.css
.hdr { a: 1 }
.hdr .logo { a: 2 }
.card { a: 3 }
.dark .card .t { a: 4 }
@@@ file: src/docs/guide/page.shtml
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../../css/site.css">
</head>
<body>
<!--#include virtual="/inc/header.html" -->
<p>guide</p>
</body>
</html>
@@@ file: src/inc/header.html
<header class="hdr"><a class="logo" href="index.shtml">x</a></header>
@@@ file: src/index.shtml
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/site.css">
</head>
<body class="dark">
<!--#include virtual="/inc/header.html" -->
<main>
<!--#include file="parts/card.html" -->
</main>
</body>
</html>
@@@ file: src/parts/card.html
<div class="card"><h3 class="t">c</h3></div>
@@@ file: src/parts/promo.html
<div class="card promo"><h3 class="t">p</h3></div>
@@@ file: src/shop.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/shop.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="shop"><include src="parts/card.html"></include></div>
<!-- the promo card goes here -->
</body>
</html>
